<title>USA: Corning Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Corning Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.38		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net			 86,600		   83,500</p>
<p> Revs		     999,000		  822,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 225,900		  226,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.76     loss	 $0.23</p>
<p> Net profit		175,600     loss	50,800</p>
<p> Revs		    3,684,500		3,257,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  227,100		  226,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net includes results from discontinued opers of loss $4.7 million vs profit $13.2 million for Q4 and loss $167.3 million vs profit $20.7 for yr.</p>
<p>Oper shr, excluding discontined opers is profit $0.40 vs profit $0.31 for Q4 and profit $1.50 vs loss $0.32 for year.</p>
<p>Revs are total revs and include royalty, interest and dividend income.</p>
<p>Sales from continuing opers are $990.1 vs $814.5 in Q4 and $3.65 bln vs $3.26 bln for yr.</p>
<p>Yr 1995 net includes $348.0 million pretax loss for equity in Dow Corning Corp.</p>
</text>
